                     VM and can be used at any time by the allocating applica‐
                     tion.  With strict overcommit enabled on the system (mode
                     2  in  _/_p_r_o_c_/_s_y_s_/_v_m_/_o_v_e_r_c_o_m_m_i_t___m_e_m_o_r_y), allocations which
                     would exceed the _C_o_m_m_i_t_L_i_m_i_t will not be permitted.  This
                     is useful if one needs to guarantee that  processes  will
                     not  fail due to lack of memory once that memory has been
                     successfully allocated.

